  m_Name: LegalConfig
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: SlitherAnts.Runtime::AntsJam.Legal.LegalConfig
  termsOfServiceVersion: 1.0.0
  termsOfServiceTitle: Terms of Service
  termsOfServiceContent: 'COLOR ANTS JAM - TERMS OF SERVICE

    Version 1.0.0


    1.
    ACCEPTANCE OF TERMS

    By accessing and playing Color Ants Jam, you agree to
    be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please
    do not use the application.


    2. LICENSE & GAMEPLAY

    Color Ants Jam grants
    you a personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to use the
    game for personal, non-commercial entertainment purposes.


    3. VIRTUAL ITEMS
    & PROGRESSION

    Game progression, levels, scores, and any virtual elements
    are purely in-game features. They possess no real-world monetary value and cannot
    be exchanged for cash or real assets.


    4. USER CONDUCT

    You agree not
    to modify, reverse engineer, decompile, or exploit the game application, its
    assets, or its code.


    5. DISCLAIMER & LIMITATION OF LIABILITY

    The game
    is provided "as is" without warranty of any kind. Under no circumstances shall
    the creators be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages
    resulting from your use of the application.


    6. CONTACT & INQUIRIES

    For
    inquiries regarding these Terms of Service, please contact support at support@colorantsjam.game.'
  termsOfServiceUrl: 
  privacyPolicyVersion: 1.0.0
  privacyPolicyTitle: Privacy Policy
  privacyPolicyContent: 'COLOR ANTS JAM - PRIVACY POLICY

    Version 1.0.0


    1.
    OVERVIEW

    We respect your privacy and are committed to safeguarding player
    data. Color Ants Jam is designed as an offline-first puzzle game.


    2. DATA
    COLLECTION & STORAGE

    - Local Gameplay Data: Progression, completed levels,
    and settings (such as sounds and vibrations) are stored locally on your device
    via PlayerPrefs.

    - Personal Information: Color Ants Jam does not collect
    your name, email, physical address, or phone number during normal offline gameplay.


    3.
    ADVERTISING & THIRD-PARTY SERVICES

    If third-party advertising or analytics
    services are integrated in future updates, player consent will be requested in
    compliance with applicable privacy regulations (such as GDPR and CCPA).


    4.
    DATA REQUESTS & DELETION

    You have the right to request information regarding
    your data or request deletion of any stored data. Please contact us via support@colorantsjam.game.


    5.
    CHANGES TO THIS POLICY

    We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time.
    Any material changes will be reflected with an updated version number and date.'
  privacyPolicyUrl: 
  accountDeletionTitle: Account Deletion and Data Request
  accountDeletionContent: 'ACCOUNT DELETION & DATA REQUEST


    Color Ants Jam stores
    your level progression, preferences, and completion records locally on your device.


    HOW
    TO DELETE YOUR DATA:

    1. Local Data: You can clear all game data at any time
    through your device settings: Settings > Apps > Color Ants Jam > Storage > Clear
    Data, or by uninstalling the application.

    2. Inquiries & Remote Data: To
    request confirmation or deletion of any service-related records, contact support
    at:

    support@colorantsjam.game


    Please include your device platform
    and any details regarding your request. We process all verifiable requests promptly.'
  accountDeletionContact: support@colorantsjam.game
